pageViews
| where timestamp > ago(14d)
| where name has "Sales Order"
| summarize
    avgDurationMS = round(avg(duration), 0)
  , pageLoads     = count()
  by bin(timestamp, 1h)
| order by timestamp asc
| render timechart
//Time-correlated spikes strongly suggest server-side load 
//(e.g., a job scheduler firing at 8 AM or an inventory adjustment running at noon). 
//Flat but elevated duration across all hours for specific users points to network.